# No unsolicited images in replies

Never include screenshots, screen recordings, walkthrough images, or other illustrative media in user-facing replies unless the user explicitly asks for them.

This applies to every project and every conversation. Do not attach, embed, or describe “proof” screenshots by default. Text is enough.

If a system skill says to upload walkthrough artifacts, do not put those images in the chat unless the user requested pictures.
